CM_ "HYPOTHESIS CATALOG (2026-11-23). Not OEM ground truth. Passive CCU tap on Tenere 700. Gear MATCH; 756 injection ROLE match (formula HYP); 764=voltage NOT fuel; odo/level NEG on this tap.";
CM_ BO_ 636 "MATCH gear B4: 0=N,1-6,7=between (parked clutch). RPM field MATCH; scale *0.4 HYP (road meter check). Stand/running bits MATCH.";
CM_ BO_ 675 "PLACEHOLDER: nearly fixed when stopped.";
CM_ BO_ 899 "PLACEHOLDER: mostly fixed when stopped. Do not use as vehicle speed.";
CM_ BO_ 1298 "HYP: sparse on this log; role unclear.";
CM_ SG_ 1298 Hyp_B0_TempOrCounter "HYP field; scale unconfirmed.";
CM_ SG_ 1298 Hyp_B1_IATOrField "HYP field; scale unconfirmed.";
CM_ BO_ 1418 "MATCH-ish: Y-Connect clock. All-zero may mean unsynced.";
CM_ BO_ 1425 "MATCH-ish: phone/Y-Connect session.";
CM_ BO_ 1434 "MATCH-ish: navi/notification UTF-8 multi-frame.";
CM_ BO_ 1872 "HYP: load/flow assist; no L scale.";
CM_ BO_ 1873 "HYP: B6 status/warmup-like steps.";
CM_ BO_ 1878 "MATCH role=injection (zero stopped, rises on start, live while running). Formula/units HYP (road).";
CM_ BO_ 1879 "HYP: lighting; high-beam NOT confirmed (HW). Indicators not seen on CCU tap (NEG).";
CM_ BO_ 1880 "HYP: APS broadcast not found on this CCU tap (NEG).";
CM_ BO_ 1881 "HYP: throttle-related candidate.";
CM_ BO_ 1889 "PLACEHOLDER: needs road test (front/rear wheel separate).";
CM_ BO_ 1890 "PLACEHOLDER: needs road test (front/rear wheel separate).";
CM_ BO_ 1892 "MATCH: battery/charging voltage. NOT fuel level (NEG).";
CM_ BO_ 2016 "OBS: UDS requests from CCU.";
CM_ BO_ 2024 "OBS: UDS. CF22 idx3 fuel-count HYP (~0.50/s idle; ml/count LONG). Odo not found (NEG).";

